## Introduction

Multivendor Marketplace App for Shopify is here with a new theme now and it would be really exciting to learn about its functions for the Admin and the Seller.

This guide will help you to understand the new theme and its functionalities.

Multivendor Marketplace App is the ultimate tool to convert your store into a fully-functioning marketplace.

Here, multiple sellers can register who can sell their products locally or globally and the admin can charge a commission on each seller’s earnings.

Firstly, let’s see how to install the Multivendor App on the Shopify Store.

## ✨ Features

- Sellers can add “group buy” products.
- Specify discount percentage, minimum member limit per group, and product validity.
- Customers can create **private groups** and invite others.
- Sellers can allow customers to create **public groups**.
- Group buying reduces cart abandonment and boosts conversion rates.
- It also increases the average order value.

## 🛠 Admin Panel Configuration

1. Admin needs to enable the *Easy Group Buy* feature in the **Feature Apps** section of the Multi-vendor Marketplace.
2. Once enabled, sellers can manage their group buy settings via their seller panels.
3. Customers will see the group buy option on applicable products.

